"<emphasis strong=\"1\">Ready to scan the next "
"page</emphasis>%1...<nl/><nl/>Prepare the next page and then use "
"<interface>Scan&nbsp;Next</interface> to scan it,<nl/>or "
"<interface>Finish</interface> to end the scan batch or "
